    "h1": {
      "en": "Motor",
      "zh": "电机"
    },
    "lede": {
      "en": "Two NEMA 17 stepper motors sit on the top extrusion of the frame, one at each side. The motors drive the CoreXY belts, which move the X carriage.",
      "zh": "两台 42 步进电机装在框架顶部的型材上，左右各一。电机驱动 CoreXY 同步带，带动 X 滑座移动。"
    }
  },
