  {
    "type": "tall-left",
    "page": "motor_30",
    "head": {
      "title": {
        "en": "MOTOR",
        "zh": "电机"
      },
      "small": "motor_30"
    },
    "variant": "hero",
    "figures": [
      {
        "src": "motor_30_pulley_exploded_cam1_wcny.svg"
      },
      {
        "src": "motor_30_pulley_assembled_cam0_ghfe.svg"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Two heights",
          "zh": "两种高度"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The Motor A belt and the Motor B belt sit at different heights. The pulley of Motor A (left) sits on the lower belt plane. The pulley of Motor B (right) sits on the upper belt plane. Slide each pulley along its motor shaft to its plane.",
          "zh": "电机 A 和电机 B 的同步带高度不同。电机 A 的同步轮（左）位于下层同步带平面。电机 B 的同步轮（右）位于上层同步带平面。把每个同步轮沿电机轴滑到对应的平面。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:40mm; top:15mm; width:90mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Set screws",
          "zh": "紧定螺钉"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "1. Tighten one set screw onto the D-flat of the shaft. 2. Tighten the other.",
          "zh": "1. 把一颗紧定螺钉对准 D 形切面拧紧。2. 拧紧另一颗。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:142mm; top:30mm; width:42mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Threadlocker",
          "zh": "螺纹胶加固"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Make sure that the pulleys and idlers are aligned. Then apply threadlocker to every set screw. A loose pulley makes the motion inaccurate. It is the most common issue users report. You can also apply the threadlocker after you install the belts.</p>",
          "zh": "<p>先确认同步轮和惰轮已对齐，再给每颗紧定螺钉涂螺纹胶。同步轮松动会导致运动失准，是用户反馈最多的问题。也可以等装好同步带后再涂。</p>"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:140mm; top:110mm; width:80mm;"
      }
    ],
